# Soldevi Machinist: "{T}: Add {C}{C}. Spend this mana only to activate abilities of artifacts." (CR 106.6; its ruling:
# not on artifact spells.) "Artifacts" are artifact permanents (CR 109.2): no "source" or "card" in the text.
# Turn 3, with only the Machinist's {C}{C} in the pool, Aether Spellbomb can't be cast; with a Mountain's {R} it can (the
# control). Once it is on the battlefield one {C} pays its "{1}, Sacrifice: Draw a card", an artifact's ability.
# Turn 5 the Machinist's {C}{C} and three Mountains' {R}{R}{R} would be the {3}{R}{R} of Phyrexian Dragon Engine's unearth,
# but that is an ability of an artifact card in the graveyard, not of an artifact (with the Mox's {U} the rest is four):
# it is not offered.

